sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub<br/>(Actions)
    participant GL as GitLab<br/>(F-Droid CI)
    participant Rel as GitHub<br/>Release v1.11.0

    Note over Dev,Rel: STEP 1: Release Preparation (Synchronous)

    Dev->>Rel: 1. Tag & Push commit
    Dev->>GH: 2. Update fdroid-data recipe<br/>(binary: URLs)

    Note over GH,GL: STEP 2: Reference Build (40-50 min, Asynchronous)

    Dev->>GH: 3. Dispatch workflow<br/>android-release.yml
    activate GH
    GH->>GH: Job "Build":<br/>Build unsigned APKs (~5 min)
    GH->>Rel: 4. Upload -unsigned.apk
    Note right of Rel: ✅ app-fdroid-*-release-unsigned.apk<br/>EXIST NOW

    GH->>GH: Job "reproducible":<br/>Build sherpa-onnx (35-45 min)
    Note right of GH: ⏳ SLOW STEP: compiling C++<br/>for 3 ABIs from source

    Note over Dev,GL: STEP 3: F-Droid CI Starts (Parallel!)

    Dev->>GL: 5. Push recipe to fork<br/>(triggers pipeline IMMEDIATELY)
    activate GL
    GL->>GL: Pipeline starts

    Note over GL: ❌ CRITICAL RACE CONDITION HERE

    GL->>GL: 6. fdroid build job starts
    GL->>Rel: 7. GET binary: URLs<br/>(app-fdroid-*-release.apk)
    Rel-->>GL: 8. ❌ 404 Not Found<br/>(NOT YET CREATED!)

    Note right of GL: ❌ BUILD FAILS<br/>exit code 1

    Note over GH: STEP 4: GitHub Still Building...

    GH->>GH: 9. sherpa-onnx completes
    GH->>GH: 10. Sign APKs (apksigner)
    GH->>Rel: 11. Upload signed APKs
    Note right of Rel: ✅ app-fdroid-*-release.apk<br/>CREATED NOW (too late!)

    GL->>GL: 12. Pipeline marked FAILED<br/>(no retry scheduled)

    Note over Dev,Rel: OUTCOME: Failure due to timing

    deactivate GH
    deactivate GL
